    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36429" root="قيا" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيُوْءٌ</span></b>  One (a man, IAar) <i>who vomits much,</i> or
<i>frequently;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيُوٌّ</span>; (IAar, K, TA;) the
latter formed from the former, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْرُوٌّ</span> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْرُوْءٌ</span>. (L, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَوَآءٌ قَيُوْءٌ</span>,] <i>Medicine
that is taken to cause vomiting;</i> (ISk, S, O;)
and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَوَآءٌ مُقَيِّئٌ</span></b>  (K, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقِىْءٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

